    {
      "id": "physics_1st-ch3-mcq-008",
      "text": "অনুভূমিকভাবে নিক্ষিপ্ত বস্তুর গতিপথের সমীকরণ নিচের কোনটি?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(x^2 = \\dfrac{2v_0^2}{g}y\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(x^2 = \\dfrac{g}{2v_0^2}y\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(y^2 = \\dfrac{1}{2}g\\left(\\dfrac{x}{v_0^2}\\right)\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(y^2 = \\dfrac{2v_0^2}{g}x^2\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "a",
      "answer_source": "derived",
      "explanation": "অনুভূমিক নিক্ষেপে \\(x=v_0t\\) এবং \\(y=\\dfrac{1}{2}gt^2\\)। \\(t=\\dfrac{x}{v_0}\\) বসিয়ে পাই \\(y=\\dfrac{g x^2}{2v_0^2}\\)\n\\(\\therefore x^2=\\dfrac{2v_0^2}{g}y\\) (পরাবৃত্তাকার পথ)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "ALL",
        "year": "2026",
